WEBVTT

00:01.564 --> 00:04.254
- Outta my way, you
psychedelic space junk!
- 别挡我的路，你
迷幻的太空垃圾！

00:05.047 --> 00:06.771
Sweet Neptune!
甜蜜的海王星！

00:06.840 --> 00:10.392
Have I found the
beginning of the universe?
我找到了吗
宇宙的开始？

00:10.461 --> 00:12.081
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:12.150 --> 00:13.702
- Ooh!
- 哦！

00:15.909 --> 00:17.840
[screams]
[尖叫声]

00:19.667 --> 00:21.392
- ♪ Who lives a
pineapple under the sea? ♪
- ♪ 谁住在
海底的菠萝？ ♪

00:21.461 --> 00:23.150
all: Grandpat Sea Star!
全体：海星爷爷！

00:23.219 --> 00:25.564
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:25.633 --> 00:27.702
all: Grandpat Sea Star!
全体：海星爷爷！

00:27.771 --> 00:29.461
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:29.530 --> 00:31.702
all: Grandpat Sea Star!
全体：海星爷爷！

00:31.771 --> 00:33.702
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.771 --> 00:35.564
all: Grandpat Sea Star!
- Ready?
全体：海星爷爷！
- 准备好？

00:35.633 --> 00:39.461
all: Grandpat Sea Star!
Grandpat Sea Star!
全体：海星爷爷！
海星爷爷！

00:39.530 --> 00:41.702
Grandpat Sea Star!
海星爷爷！

00:41.771 --> 00:43.150
Grandpat
爷爷

00:43.219 --> 00:45.874
Sea Star!
- Oh! Ow!
海星！
- 哦！噢！

00:45.943 --> 00:47.426
[laughter]
[笑声]

00:47.495 --> 00:49.771
[dentures clicking
rhythmically]
[假牙咔哒声
有节奏地]

00:49.840 --> 00:50.943
Ow!
噢！

00:51.012 --> 00:53.185
I gotta get out
of this nightmare!
我得出去
这个噩梦！

00:53.254 --> 00:54.530
[gasps] Ohh!
[喘气]哦！

00:54.598 --> 00:56.150
[shimmering tone]
[闪烁的音调]

00:56.219 --> 00:57.530
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

00:59.254 --> 01:02.150
[intense Western music]
【强烈的西洋音乐】

01:02.219 --> 01:04.840
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:04.909 --> 01:05.874
- [spits]
- [吐口水]

01:05.943 --> 01:06.840
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:06.909 --> 01:08.288
- [spits]
- [吐口水]

01:08.874 --> 01:10.219
- [spits]
- [吐口水]

01:10.288 --> 01:14.909
- This town ain't big enough
for the both of us.
- 这个城镇不够大
为了我们俩。

01:14.978 --> 01:16.081
[electricity crackles]
[电流爆裂声]

01:16.150 --> 01:17.805
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

01:17.874 --> 01:18.978
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

01:21.357 --> 01:23.530
- Whoa!
- Ahh!
- 哇！
- 啊！

01:27.323 --> 01:28.426
Ohh!
哦！

01:28.495 --> 01:29.840
[electricity crackles]
[电流爆裂声]

01:30.047 --> 01:32.047
- [munching]
- [咀嚼]

01:32.116 --> 01:37.357
- Um--this town ain't big
enough for the both of us.
- 嗯——这个小镇不大
对我们俩来说足够了。

01:37.426 --> 01:38.461
[gong splash]
[锣声四溅]

01:38.530 --> 01:40.564
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

01:49.978 --> 01:52.564
- Now that's
a good looking baby!
- 现在就是这样
一个好看的宝贝！

01:55.081 --> 01:57.185
- [neighs]
- [嘶嘶声]

01:57.254 --> 01:59.254
- Well, this is my stop.
- 嗯，这是我的站。

01:59.323 --> 02:01.254
See y'all later!
稍后见！

02:01.323 --> 02:03.185
Hyep!
Giddy-up, now!
嗨！
头晕目眩，现在！

02:03.254 --> 02:07.116
- [neighs]
- Yahoo!
- [嘶嘶声]
- 雅虎！

02:07.185 --> 02:08.736
- Happy trails!
- 快乐的足迹！

02:08.805 --> 02:11.047
[electricity zapping]
Ahh!
[电击]
啊！

02:11.805 --> 02:12.771
Ohh!
哦！

02:12.840 --> 02:14.254
[crashing]
[崩溃]

02:14.323 --> 02:15.943
[groaning]
[呻吟]

02:16.012 --> 02:17.598
Uh! Yah!
呃！啊！

02:17.667 --> 02:20.805
[playing Polka music]
[演奏波尔卡音乐]

02:20.874 --> 02:23.771
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:23.840 --> 02:24.840
- Bonjour.
- 你好。

02:24.909 --> 02:26.116
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

02:26.185 --> 02:29.185
It's good to be back home
where it's normal.
回到家真好
这是正常的。

02:29.254 --> 02:30.564
- Hi, Grandpat--
- Huh?
-嗨，爷爷--
- 啊？

02:30.633 --> 02:32.357
- What you watching?
- 你在看什么？

02:32.426 --> 02:33.633
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

02:35.185 --> 02:36.978
Ehh, close enough.
呃，够接近了。

02:38.426 --> 02:41.392
- And so we leave things
a little bit weird,
- 所以我们留下东西
有点奇怪，

02:41.461 --> 02:45.392
but that's how we like it
here in "The Tidal Zone."
但这就是我们喜欢的方式
这里是“潮汐区”。

02:45.461 --> 02:46.805
Au revoir.
再见。

02:46.874 --> 02:49.495
[static buzzing]
- Hey, I was watching that!
[静电嗡嗡声]
- 嘿，我正在看那个！

[静电嗡嗡声]
- 嘿，我正在看那个！